    "KiFinder finds your people entirely on your Mac. To do that it needs a one-time, ~249 MB face-recognition model. It downloads once and stays on this Mac — no photos ever leave the device.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KiFinder finds your people entirely on your Mac. To do that it needs a one-time, ~249 MB face-recognition model. It downloads once and stays on this Mac — no photos ever leave the device."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KiFinderはすべての処理をこのMac上で行い、探したい人物を見つけます。そのために、一度だけ約249 MBの顔認識モデルが必要です。ダウンロードは一度きりで、このMacに保存されます。写真がデバイスの外に出ることはありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KiFinder isn't allowed to add photos to your Photos library. Grant access in System Settings > Privacy & Security > Photos, then try again.": {
